# Phase 18 compatibility release gate execution log

Started: 2026-10-22 02:20 UTC
Plan: `plan/2026/09/19-phase-18-compatibility-release-gate.md`
Branch: `phase/18-phase-18-compatibility-closure`
Slice: P18-V01 direct `MQClientAPIImpl.getAllTopicConfig`, request 21

## Source baseline

Compared the RPC and DTO behavior with pinned RocketMQ Java 5.5.1 source at
`efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9`, including `MQClientAPIImpl`,
`GetAllTopicConfigRequestHeader`, `GetAllTopicConfigResponseHeader`,
`TopicConfigSerializeWrapper`, and `DataVersion`. The local Java checkout is
not used as pinned-source evidence.

## Changes

- Added `MQClientApi::get_all_topic_config` with one overall deadline,
  configured VIP routing and metadata page size, version-change restart, and
  the legacy missing/invalid `totalTopicNum` path.
- Added both typed request/response headers and the `DataVersion` and
  `TopicConfigSerializeWrapper` protocol models.
- Added invoked Java cases for single/multiple pages, changed versions,
  legacy responses, malformed/missing/null response data, Broker errors, and
  timeouts; added a Rust scripted-peer differential for all 12 cases.
- Added bidirectional header/body fixtures and updated the request-code,
  API-map, and reverse-audit records. The direct API remainder is now 11 rows.
- Made the new producer fixture's version-result map deterministic with a
  sorted map; Java `Map.of` serialization order varied between JVM processes.

## Verification

- `mvn -o -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml -DskipTests compile` — passed.
- `mvn -o -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml exec:java@verify-java-producer-core-fixtures -Dproducer.core.fixture.verify=false` — regenerated the fixture.
- `mvn -o -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml exec:java@verify-java-producer-core-fixtures` — passed after regeneration.
- Rust generated typed fixtures with `cargo run --locked -p rocketmq-classic-remoting --example generate_fixtures -- p4-headers target/p4-rust-header-fixtures` and `p4-bodies target/p4-rust-body-fixtures`; the pinned Java verifier decoded 93 headers and 17 typed bodies.
- `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-protocol --locked` — passed (154 unit tests, all package integration targets, and 156 doctests).
- `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-core --test admin_rpc --locked` — passed (95 tests).
- `cargo clippy -p rocketmq-classic-protocol -p rocketmq-classic-core --all-targets --locked -- -D warnings` — passed.
- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and `git diff --check` — passed.

