## Scope status

No Broker, Docker, or remote CI was used. The 11 other direct API rows,
broader P18-V01 reverse/API/config/feature/flow reconciliation, P18-V02
offline/fuzz/race evidence, current-revision platform evidence, and the
remaining Phase 18 gates are still open. This execution closes only the
request 21 slice.

Cleanup: an initial manual Java fixture call used a relative output path and
created `/Users/bruce.tsai/Projects/fixtures/remoting` outside the repository.
Its directory creation time matched that call; the generated directory was
